title: API routes
description: Route handlers for what is not a page. The export of pages, whiteboards and projects, pictures and videos, error reports, Stripe's subscription events, and the operator's daily summary. Stripe and the cron are the only callers without a signed-in user.
connects:
  - to: src/lib/billing
    label: subscription events
    description: Stripe signs each event; the handler verifies the signature, then writes the subscription's state to the workspace's plan with the server's secret key. Everything else in the app reads that plan through row-level security.
